  "_about": "Words that trigger each voice command after speech recognition. Matching is on the normalized transcript (lower case, no punctuation). A command matches only when the whole utterance is the command phrase, or the utterance has at most 3 words and starts with it, so questions such as 'what does the sign say' are never mistaken for commands. Anything that matches no command is treated as a QUESTION and goes to the Ask pipeline. The microphone is paused while Oriel speaks, so it never hears its own voice. Telugu and Hindi are drafts: add the words your testers actually say.",
